WEBVTT

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:33.663
but about a specific behavior:
"I did a bad thing."

00:00:34.597 --> 00:00:37.997
And it's a subtle distinction,

00:00:37.997 --> 00:00:41.530
but it turns out that it leads to
very different motivations.

00:00:41.563 --> 00:00:45.530
So, when people feel shame about
"Who I am because I did a bad thing,

00:00:45.563 --> 00:00:47.930
I'm a horrible person,"

00:00:47.963 --> 00:00:51.163
there's a sense of shrinking
and being small,

00:00:51.163 --> 00:00:54.097
a sense of worthlessness
and powerlessness.

00:00:54.530 --> 00:00:57.530
And when people feel shame,
they want to hide.

00:00:57.563 --> 00:00:59.097
They want to sink into the floor

00:00:59.130 --> 00:01:00.263
and disappear.